    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "Kofra API token",
        "description": "An API token from the console, sent as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\nTokens carry scopes; each operation names the scopes it needs.\nScopes: `account:read`, `account:delete`, `buckets:read`,\n`buckets:write`, `buckets:delete`, `keys:read`, `keys:write`,\n`usage:read`, `events:read`, `objects:read`. A token's effective\npermission is its scopes limited by its member's workspace role.\n"
